  <item>
    <title>Vol.006 舞台剧 | 维罗妮卡的房间：朋友，千万别为了做好事跟陌生人回家！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668a97eb0bc5d7cc70700044</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668a97eb0bc5d7cc70700044</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Karon /阿没</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期前言】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Karon和阿没分别在不同时间段去看了在上海驻演的舞台剧——维罗妮卡的房间。一个疑云密布的房间，一场因为善意引发的“血案”，一场跨越时空的心理惊悚之旅。快来和我们一起揭开这个房间的神秘面纱吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目剧透】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 买票省钱小妙招</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 故事究竟在讲什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 白色纱布遮挡的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">05:37</a> 强烈推荐的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 时间谜团：今夕何夕？1974年还是1935年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 身份谜团：女孩究竟是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> &nbsp;终极谜团：活下来的究竟是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 《维罗妮卡的房间》 vs 《死亡陷阱》&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp8MMQzhaqerVJNvrB0K5021JyZD.m4a" length="33645018" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FupCb_UzcDuRSzddl8n8O8YnODZv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.005 舞台剧 | 不眠之夜：J人手把手教你拉满体验感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6682a5fecdd230b23b7df38f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6682a5fecdd230b23b7df38f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Karon / 橘子 / 阿没</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期前言】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿没体验完上海不眠之夜，观感超好，观后怒写千字小论文~</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘子则是之前二刷过这部戏，知道好多追主线的攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟随主播一起探秘传闻已久的沉浸式演出吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目剧透】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> 不眠之夜究竟讲了啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 爆闪表演演出了小说中不曾有的精彩~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 阿没的攻略：选票很关键！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 乌泱泱的人群中，要怎样才能追上主角的步伐呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 不认识人不要紧，有长桌晚宴帮你认！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 第一、第二、第三场有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 三个故事是怎样的交织？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 不眠之夜最精彩的是什么？故事，表演，还是感官体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 多刷的理由：1v1的互动彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> 纯看表演 or 小住一晚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 最实惠的角色路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 竟然还有动物化表演！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 如何开启隐藏剧情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> &nbsp;密苏里74号：苏州也有沉浸式表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 爆闪：增加恐惧感的科技与狠货</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnkSVw7lXAAS8Jcrtnk-QZL0YDi8.m4a" length="71866888" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frg_qn3ReikUnowIOxsdV6Lk--dr.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.004 桌游 | 血染钟楼：信我！我铁好人啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66780766b6a8412729b6e8b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66780766b6a8412729b6e8b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Karon / 橘子 / 阿没</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期概况】</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于玩到了心心念念的</span><strong><span>血染钟楼</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在逻辑与谎言交织的“村庄”里</span></p><span></span><p><span>体验狼人杀+阿瓦隆的升级</span></p><span></span><p><span>享受推理桌游的无穷乐趣~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目剧透】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 血染钟楼究竟是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 阵营的划分：什么？好人不一定做好事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 玩家人数配置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a> 人人都有技能！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 玩家可以私聊~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 信息位超级重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 和狼人杀的不同点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 线下被高能玩家狂虐&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> 血染钟楼的好玩点：一定要推理出每个坏人究竟是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 配板子？新知识点get</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 说书人可不只是个报幕的上帝而已哟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 只想当好人？不，坏人更有游戏体验！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> 太可气了！被高玩骗还被高玩嘲笑</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrCANtMiSk_x1Ah4nmih4bRWYWJ7.m4a" length="63351988" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftj2dIffxqJJAMFvROurkbf7h2bd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
